{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0423_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9b99bbf7b01fa027031b265f2262930cc680f85cb1a232db8fd2ea97b22d89e1", "ja": "（テーマパークでの仕事が終了した。人形師の仮装を\nした美希は、見事な人形劇でお客さんを楽しませた）", "zh": "（主题公园的工作结束了。美希装扮成人偶师，用精彩的人偶剧让客人们度过了愉快的时光。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0423_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "770f67542ea68142e603e1333e16a0441cf7d9c27e7d3ee8e25072903d393772", "ja": "お疲れさまなの、{$P$}！\nどうだった？　ミキ、上手だったでしょ？", "zh": "辛苦啦，{$P$}！\n怎么样？美希刚才表现得很棒吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0423_1002_p", "source_sha256": "87d6371300e4a0d1b474426d8e3f444b13b847243f2775da9d466fd71f3b8aae", "ja": "ああ、すごかったよ。\nしっかり会場を沸かせていたし、さすがだな！", "zh": "啊，很精彩。\n现场气氛也被你充分调动起来了，不愧是你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0423_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "abc0c3930a1aac3b82658d0d53ebb79d3016f9876fba08032e8ac1edb77c65cf", "ja": "あはっ☆　ありがとうなの！\nじゃあ、{$P$}的には……。", "zh": "啊哈☆　谢谢你！\n那，在{$P$}看来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0423_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "fef9dd7a685d8c4932f274db5c94e825cc773259376cffcd05b77a0de83ce406", "ja": "今日のミキ、すごく頑張ったって\n思ってくれてるんだよね？", "zh": "你觉得今天的美希特别努力，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0423_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3705b28a99eaf84d1d899198eae9d1ba47d8ea5a52e734925ace557ab9703042", "ja": "もちろん！\nん？　わざわざ念を押すってことは……。", "zh": "当然！\n嗯？特意再确认一遍，难道是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0423_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "2b25e7df5b4c4fc40f52031fe1f6ba1a5a75027300b40c39ceeb7a2b061fb7e0", "ja": "ミキ、ハニーからのゴホウビが欲しいな♪\nねぇねぇハニー、ミキのお願い聞いてくれるよね？", "zh": "美希想要哈尼给的奖励♪  \n呐呐，哈尼会答应美希的请求吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0423_1007_p", "source_sha256": "276106f201b32060588107490a5d48566af855390c9e6053daf550c42ce36302", "ja": "やっぱりそういうことか……。\nまあ、頑張ったのは事実だから、一つだけなら。", "zh": "果然是这么回事啊……\n不过，你确实很努力，如果只有一个要求的话倒是可以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0423_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "6b896f68fef44ee41d507cc37db38d07c99545dbec44d3def2d0ec9d70eccab4", "ja": "わーい♪　それじゃあ、ミキからのお願い。\n今日一日、ハニーは……ミキの操り人形になるの～！", "zh": "太好啦♪　那么，美希的愿望是——\n今天一整天，亲爱的要……做美希的提线木偶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0423_1009_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0423_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "b5ad24d5b95832322f365b2150743f243edd7e3b7426c410819cc70b2d4890ab", "ja": "今からぜーんぶミキの言う通りにしなきゃダメだよ？", "zh": "从现在开始，你可得全部都按美希说的做哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0423_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "972ef0ce68e32ce313e7ea91980675d65da32fa974e6152048019feba54706cf", "ja": "ミキの行きたいところとかやりたいこととか、\nいーっぱい、付き合ってね♪", "zh": "要陪美希去好多她想去的地方，做好多她想做的事哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0423_1012_p", "source_sha256": "092c45c7589833e2b6df14e47ebd6d3d723d8ecfbbd9eed13f3871bb1d49454a", "ja": "ち、ちょっと待った！\nご褒美は一つだけって……。", "zh": "等、等一下！\n奖励只能有一个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0423_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "b6e26a85d470e6bc662f2add6a5af499d3c73efddfcabc7a3da93c5e872c4a08", "ja": "うん、だから一つだけだよ？\n「操り人形になって」ってお願いしか言ってないの。", "zh": "嗯，所以就只有一个呀？\n美希只说了“当美希的提线木偶”这一个要求嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0423_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "0339734efc5b20b67b32600ca8d108832c0e800657bab7e508de2c067fb6cc14", "ja": "他のお願いは、操り人形さんへのお願いだから……\nトーゼン、叶えてくれるよね♪", "zh": "其他愿望，都是对提线木偶先生的愿望啦……\n当然会帮我实现的吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0423_1015_p", "source_sha256": "29b4f63decc0777dd0c55778c60411f42ad303ecb849095088dc6f4ef94731a0", "ja": "なるほど……？\nなんだか、うまいこと言いくるめられてるような……。", "zh": "原来如此……？\n总觉得好像被巧妙地忽悠了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0423_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "d70ed0e98e41da856b130b7ca73e0d96fd5c41f72d64bcb235ac310f433154a2", "ja": "気のせいだって思うな。ほらほら、\n早くデートに行こっ。ミキの大切な、操り人形さん♪", "zh": "可别以为只是你的错觉哦。来嘛来嘛，快点去约会吧。美希最珍爱的提线木偶先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
